{"title":"Doane triMATHlon Math Contest","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#About_the_Doane_University_triMATHlon_math_contest\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">About the Doane University triMATHlon math contest</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Extreme_Team_Challenge\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Extreme Team Challenge</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Individual_Written_Exam\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Individual Written Exam</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Math_Bowl\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Math Bowl</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_Links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External Links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About_the_Doane_University_triMATHlon_math_contest\">About the Doane University triMATHlon math contest</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Doane_triMATHlon_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: About the Doane University triMATHlon math contest\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The Doane University triMATHlon Contest is for students in the 9th-12th grade. It consists of three stages: the Extreme Team Challenge, the Individual Written Exam, and the Math Bowl.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Extreme_Team_Challenge\">Extreme Team Challenge</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Doane_triMATHlon_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Extreme Team Challenge\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>3-person teams have 45 minutes to solve questions involving Doane’s campus and to provide written solutions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Individual_Written_Exam\">Individual Written Exam</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Doane_triMATHlon_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Individual Written Exam\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consists of a 30 question, multiple choice exam with a time limit of 45 minutes.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Math_Bowl\">Math Bowl</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Doane_triMATHlon_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Math Bowl\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>3-person teams compete against each other in a single-elimination style tournament.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_Links\">External Links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Doane_triMATHlon_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: External Links\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>For more information, see: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.doane.edu/trimathlon\">https://www.doane.edu/trimathlon</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018002709\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 14/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20266:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018002709 and revision id 140922. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}